  "schoolyard": 1,
  "schoolyard_use_notes": "This tree has compound leaves with multiple leaflets that can be used to teach about leaf structure and compound versus simple leaves. It is deciduous, making it a good example for lessons on seasonal changes. The tree produces clusters of small, winged seeds that spin as they fall, illustrating seed dispersal by wind. Its adaptability to different environments can also serve as a discussion point for plant resilience and habitat preferences.",
